  "description": "Whitty’s Cottage, Whitty’s Hill, Wellingtonbridge, Co. Wexford – Y35 P9W9\n\nGillian Hayes Property Letting is delighted to introduce Whitty’s Cottage to the rental market — a charming two-bedroom detached cottage, available for first-time letting and offering a wonderful opportunity to rent a beautiful home in a peaceful setting in Wellingtonbridge, Co. Wexford.\n\nLovingly presented and furnished to a high standard throughout, this delightful cottage is set on a large private site and combines traditional charm with comfortable modern living. The property also benefits from a detached garage, ample private parking and generous outdoor space.\n\nAccommodation comprises:\n\n• Entrance hallway\n• Comfortable sitting room with solid fuel stove\n• Fully fitted kitchen/diner with adjoining snug area\n• Utility room\n• Stylish wet room\n• Two spacious double bedrooms upstairs\n\n\n• Oil-fired central heating\n• Available immediately\n• Minimum lease term: 12 months\n• Strictly no pets\n\nApplication Process\n\nDue to the exceptionally high level of demand for rental properties in County Wexford, interested applicants are asked to apply directly through this advertisement and fully complete our online application process.   \n\nGillian Hayes Property Letting is one of Wexford’s longest-established property letting and property management agencies, specialising in residential lettings, property management and rental properties throughout Wexford.\n\nAvailable immediately. Minimum lease term of 12 months.\n\nwww.wexfordlettings.com",
